    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "The change is complete and the full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 2/2 tests passing, 0 failures).\n\n## Summary\n\nI added a structured address form to the owner create flow, keeping the flat `address` input working for backward compatibility.\n\n**What I changed (5 files):**\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added `addressLine1` and optional `addressLine2` to the `OwnerFields` schema (they flow into the `Owner`/`OwnerDto` response via the existing `allOf`), and removed `address` from the `required` list so structured-only requests validate. `city` stays required.\n\n2. **`Owner.java`** \u2014 Added two persisted fields `addressLine1` / `addressLine2` (with `@Column` and simple getters/setters). No existing method was modified.\n\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Normalized `addressLine1`/`addressLine2` through the existing `normalizeAddress` qualifier, and added one small cohesive `composeAddress(...)` default method that builds the stored/returned `address`: prefer a non-blank normalized `addressLine1` (with normalized `addressLine2` appended after a single space when present), else fall back to the normalized flat `address`.\n\n4. **`db/hsqldb/schema.sql`** (the schema the tests use, `ddl-auto=none`) \u2014 Added the two columns at the **end** of the `owners` table so the positional seed inserts stay aligned.\n\n5. **`db/hsqldb/data.sql`** \u2014 Appended the two matching `NULL` values to each seed owner row.\n\n**Design notes on structural impact:** All new behaviour lives in small, low-complexity units \u2014 one new default method in the mapper (a class whose surrounding methods are trivial) plus plain field accessors on the entity. I modified no complex method inside any large class (the controller and policies were left untouched, since address composition happens entirely at mapping time and everything reading `owner.getAddress()` transparently gets the composed value). The other DB profiles (h2/postgres/mysql) already rely on Hibernate `ddl-auto=update` and use column-list inserts, so they needed no change.",
